OL,3,GNEWSABaby's death prompts coroner
OL,4,Acodeine concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FA coroner has said clinicians were
OL,7,F"insufficiently clear" on the dangers
OL,8,Fof codeine use after the death of a
OL,9,Fnewborn baby.
OL,11,FAssistant coroner for Cumbria Robert
OL,12,FCohen said Isla McVeigh, who died one
OL,13,Fmonth after being born in June 2024,
OL,14,Fwas found to be dependent on opiates
OL,15,Fbecause her mother was taking codeine.
OL,17,FCohen said clinicians "agreed they had
OL,18,Fnot sought to probe the nature of
OL,19,Fopiate use" and while Isla was in
OL,20,Fspecial care, "there were limited
OL,21,Frecords of discussion of the use of
OL,22,Fopiates".
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
